"your notes on this computer."
msgstr ""
"Décisions, actions et questions ouvertes, rédigées à partir de la "
"transcription et de vos notes, sur cet ordinateur."

#: app/src/window.rs:1607
msgid ""
"Decisions, action items and open questions, written from the transcript and "
"your notes on this computer. The first time, Minutes downloads the model "
"that writes it: %d MB."
